# Resource (kurrentcloud_acl)

Manages Access Control Lists (ACLs) for KurrentDB instances

## Example Usage

{{tffile "examples/resources/acl/example_1.tf"}}

<!-- schema generated by tfplugindocs -->

## Schema

### Required

- **acl** (String) JSON document containing the access control list
- **managed_cluster_id** (String) ID of the managed cluster to apply the ACL to

### Optional

- **id** (String) The ID of this resource.

## Import

Import is supported using the following syntax:

```shell
terraform import kurrentcloud_acl.example project_id:cluster_id
```